    Ship &lt;span class="sui-typewriter sui-typewriter-cursor sui-typewriter-primary" data-sui-typewriter data-reserve data-words="faster|smaller bundles|accessible interfaces" data-loop&gt;faster&lt;/span&gt; with SoftUI.
  &lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;p style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--sui-text);"&gt;
    Status: &lt;span class="sui-typewriter sui-typewriter-cursor-block" data-sui-typewriter data-reserve data-words="Building|Testing|Deploying|Live" data-loop data-sr-text="Build status"&gt;Building&lt;/span&gt; — this sentence stays put.
  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;!-- data-reserve: width of the longest phrase, so nothing after it reflows --&gt;
&lt;!-- Text inside a data-words element is shown first, then typed over
     (if it matches the first phrase, typing continues from there) --&gt;
&lt;!-- data-sr-text: what screen readers hear (default: all phrases, comma-separated) --&gt;
&lt;!-- prefers-reduced-motion: static text, no typing
     (first phrase with data-loop, last phrase without) --&gt;</pre></div>
